{"id":"n3651877a19","headline":"Excise taxes fuel, petrol and diesel cost more: how much does the full tank increase","summary":"The discount on fuel excise duties in Ireland has ended, so petrol and diesel prices increase from Saturday. Reports give the rise in the cost of a full tank.","why":"Excise duties are a major component of retail fuel prices, so changes to them feed directly into consumer costs and transport inflation.","category":"economy","event_type":"regulation","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Dublin","country":"Ireland","lat":53.35,"lon":-6.26,"region":"eu"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"IrishDentist.ie","url":"https://www.irishdentist.ie/excise-taxes-fuel-petrol-and-diesel-cost-more-how-much-does-the-full-tank-increase/19870/"},"sources":[{"name":"IrishDentist.ie","url":"https://www.irishdentist.ie/excise-taxes-fuel-petrol-and-diesel-cost-more-how-much-does-the-full-tank-increase/19870/"}],"published_at":"2026-07-04T16:35:06Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T13:01:10Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"f6e662b99f826074","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T13:01:10Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-07-04T16:35:06Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-07-04T18:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IT","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/oil-refinery-6226244.jpg","alt":"oil refinery (illustration)","credit":"tasukaran","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/sunset-factory-buildings-6226244/"}}